# The release key's certificate SHA-256 (docs/DEVELOPING.md, Signing). scripts/build-apk.sh stops a
# release build signed with any other key: an update only installs over the same key, so a wrong
# keystore secret would publish an APK that no one with the app can update to. Change this only to
# move to a new key on purpose, which makes it a new app as far as phones and stores are concerned.
